"","email_preheader":"","email_reply_to":"","email_sender_name":"","email_body":"","email_send_now":"0","email_include_session_data":"1","email_data_privacy":"0","link":"","link_new_tab":"0","link_direct":"1","open_tree_id":"0","open_tree_node_id":"0","return_tree_node_id":"0","randomize_scoring":"0","advanced_logic_node":"0","tag":"","jsmessage":"","value":"1","probability":"500","updated":"0","display_order":"2","score_running_total":"1","continuation_node_id":"0","continuation_button_text":"","allow_pdf_download":"0","doc_node_type":"html","pdf_url_variable":"pdf_url","escalate_after":"0","escalate_after_unit":"","search_scope":"0","ai_action_id":"0","formfields":{"0":{"type":"select","name":"selection_2","label":"","label_type":"L","options":"Jo\nNee","hidden_value":"","custom_regex":"","inline":"0","required":"0","score_var":"selection_2_bool","checkbox_score":"1","scores":"true\nfalse","rank":"1","config":"{\"filterable\":true}"}},"buttons":{},"data_connected_objects":{},"app_messages":{}},"3":{"type":"Content","is_root":"0","node_name":"claude.md","page_title":"claude.md","content":"# claude.md - Debbi eLanguages (tree 908346415)\n\n## Purpose\nLocalization demo tree. Shows the house pattern for yes/no questions asked in\ndifferent languages: the option text stays in the local language for the agent,\nbut a per-field **score variable** normalizes the answer to an English boolean\n(`true`/`false`) so downstream logic/validation never has to know the language.\n\n## Architecture\nFlow: Node 1 (root) --\"No Title\" button--> Node 2.\n- Node 1  Content \"Start Node\"  - select `selection` (options: Si / No, Spanish).\n- Node 2  Content \"New Node\"    - select `selection_2` (options: Jo / Nee, Dutch).\n- Node 3  Content \"claude.md\"   - UNLINKED memory node (this file). Not in flow.\n\n## Data dictionary (form variables)\nEach yes/no select keeps localized display options and maps them positionally\nto true/false via the field's `scores` list; the mapped value lands in `score_var`.\n- `selection`        raw picked text (\"Si\"/\"No\")  [node 1]\n- `selection_bool`   score_var -> \"true\" | \"false\" [node 1]  <- validate on this\n- `selection_2`      raw picked text (\"Jo\"/\"Nee\")  [node 2]\n- `selection_2_bool` score_var -> \"true\" | \"false\" [node 2]  <- validate on this\n\nValidate anywhere with a single language-agnostic check, e.g. logic-node\nexpression `(selection_bool == 'true')`, regardless of the display language.\n\n## Conventions & gotchas\n- Standardization pattern: for any 2-option yes/no select in ANY language, set\n  `score_var = <fieldname>_bool` and `scores = \"true\\nfalse\"` (yes option -> true,\n  no option -> false), ordered to match `options`. Leave `options` localized.\n- `scores` maps positionally to `options` (newline-separated, same order). Same\n  mechanism Experian uses (Yes/No -> scores 1\\n0); here the values are true/false.\n- A form field with no `name` is not captured - node 2's field was unnamed and\n  was given `name = selection_2` so its score_var can populate.\n\n## Changelog\n- 2026-07-14 - Brent / \"standardize localized yes-no fields to boolean score vars\"\n  - Node 1 `selection`: added score_var `selection_bool`, scores true/false (Si->true, No->false).\n  - Node 2: named the field `selection_2`; added score_var `selection_2_bool`, scores true/false (Jo->true, Nee->false).\n  - Added this unlinked claude.md memory node.\n","question":"","keywords":"","confirmation_text":"","notes":"","project_node_id":"3","score_var":"","x":"-1","y":"300","width":"150","height":"75","level":"0","buttons_across":"0","resolution_state":"?","hide_back_restart":"0","hide_persistent_buttons":"0","hide_from_search":"1","repeat_form":"1","form_columns":"1","email":"","email_bcc":"","email_return_url":"","email_subject":"","email_preheader":"","email_reply_to":"","email_sender_name":"","email_body":"","email_send_now":"0","email_include_session_data":"1","email_data_privacy":"0","link":"","link_new_tab":"0","link_direct":"1","open_tree_id":"0","open_tree_node_id":"0","return_tree_node_id":"0","randomize_scoring":"0","advanced_logic_node":"0","tag":"","jsmessage":"","value":"1","probability":"500","updated":"0","display_order":"3","score_running_total":"1","continuation_node_id":"0","continuation_button_text":"","allow_pdf_download":"0","doc_node_type":"html","pdf_url_variable":"pdf_url","escalate_after":"0","escalate_after_unit":"","search_scope":"0","ai_action_id":"0","formfields":{},"buttons":{},"data_connected_objects":{},"app_messages":{}}},"predefined_vars":{}}